00:27:00.640 --> 00:27:04.840
that you don't need to shift left as much as before.

464
00:27:04.880 --> 00:27:05.960
You stay more. Right.

465
00:27:05.960 --> 00:27:11.440
And I'm curious about that, because isn't it better for agents

