00:27:17.440 --> 00:27:23.120
Like what do you mean by staying more right and not shifting left?

468
00:27:23.320 --> 00:27:27.400
So I think once you kind of put these structures in place to surface

469
00:27:27.400 --> 00:27:32.560
these requirements to the models at the right time, it becomes pretty easy

470
00:27:32.560 --> 00:27:36.040
to rely on them for the most part to auto discover this stuff.

471
00:27:36.160 --> 00:27:40.240
It is very often the case that our agents

472
00:27:40.840 --> 00:27:43.920
paints a picture of which guardrail files are relevant,

