00:27:43.920 --> 00:27:47.720
for which categories of changes backend working on the design system,

474
00:27:47.720 --> 00:27:51.080
these sorts of things where the models will just naturally page

475
00:27:51.080 --> 00:27:54.560
those sets of persona oriented guardrails into into context,

